      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Sum = 1+2+3+4+5 = 15. Average = 15/5 = 3.",
      "hash": "3deb81baf2b2828b",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "प्रथम 5 प्राकृतिक संख्याओं का औसत ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "2",
            "B": "3",
            "C": "4",
            "D": "5"
          },
          "explanation": "योग = 1+2+3+4+5 = 15. औसत = 15/5 = 3."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mock-test-session-i-10-007",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "The area of a square is 100 sq cm. Find its perimeter.",
      "options": {
        "A": "20 cm",
        "B": "30 cm",
        "C": "40 cm",
        "D": "50 cm"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Side = sqrt(100) = 10. Perimeter = 4 * 10 = 40 cm.",
      "hash": "a400bc43708d1028",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक वर्ग का क्षेत्रफल 100 वर्ग सेमी है। इसका परिमाप ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "20 सेमी",
            "B": "30 सेमी",
            "C": "40 सेमी",
            "D": "50 सेमी"
          },
          "explanation": "भुजा = sqrt(100) = 10. परिमाप = 4 * 10 = 40 सेमी।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mock-test-session-i-10-008",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "A train 150 m long passes a pole in 10 seconds. Find its speed in km/h.",
      "options": {
        "A": "45 km/h",
        "B": "54 km/h",
        "C": "60 km/h",
        "D": "72 km/h"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Speed = 150/10 = 15 m/s. In km/h = 15 * 18/5 = 54 km/h.",
      "hash": "58cafe77f5f21d7f",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "150 मीटर लंबी एक ट्रेन एक खंभे को 10 सेकंड में पार करती है। इसकी गति किमी/घंटा में ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "45 किमी/घंटा",
            "B": "54 किमी/घंटा",
            "C": "60 किमी/घंटा",
            "D": "72 किमी/घंटा"
          },
          "explanation": "गति = 150/10 = 15 मीटर/सेकंड। किमी/घंटा में = 15 * 18/5 = 54 किमी/घंटा।"
        }
      }
    },
